Package: effectagram
Title: Cross-Generalized Effect Geometry
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "bradley.buchsbaum@gmail.com")
Description: Implements a cross-generalized evidence calculus for asking where
    task effects and representational geometries reproduce across declared data
    partitions. Crossvalidated contrast energy, squared-distance
    representational dissimilarity matrices, fixed linear representational
    similarity analysis, and ordered cross-axis hypotheses are queries against
    one estimand-bearing effect form. Spatial measurements, generalization
    pairings, units, execution receipts, uncertainty capabilities, and
    principled refusals remain explicit.
